# Agon 01_sand_entrance_dark (42b935e4,01_sand_entrance_dark): Parasites in layers 1-3; put one on
# the player for contact damage. With tools/cov/specs/dol1_para.py (force.sh: IceZoomer arm).
@f30 layer 1; layer 2; layer 3
@f150 objs Parasite
@f160 send e0007005b Activate; place e0007005b player 0.5
@f200 place e0007005b player 0.3
@f260 place e0007005b player 0.3
@f320 status
@f400 place e0007027e player 0.3
@f460 place e0007027e player 0.3
@f520 status
